model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Account health retains the renewal reason and only closed protocol evidence, never vendor response text or credentials. Recognized invalid_grant remains reconnect-required; outages, rate limits and client refusal keep their existing grant semantics. Old failures remain readable without inventing a cause. Supported reconnect actions use the existing app connection path and preserve saved account identity, links and access. Moved and added OAuth evidence contracts retain pure IIFE initializer wrappers so browser builds can eliminate unused schemas. The extracted failure-evidence module preserves current provider codes, fields and stages, while each closed recovery appears once and unsupported vendor text stays private."
    }
  }
}
